Z||000000||AusFiero||06-18-2001||09:44 AM||||Well here I was working on the Porsche in Photoshop. Had just debadged it and smoothed the body out, removed the handles and put a new front spoiler on. Things were looking good.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/porschesmooth_1.jpg"> <P>Well it was time to get daring and remove 2 inches from the windscreen line. So I fired up the photoshop oxy torch plug-in and the phone rang. Well when I came back I had discovered I had left the plug-in on and all my efforts have been in vain as the Porsche was engulfed in flames.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/porscheburnt.jpg"> <P>Man that sux  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Warning: Always remember to turn off the oxy torch plugin if leaving your computer everyone or your car art may also suffer this fate.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||11
