Z||000011||AusFiero||06-18-2001||07:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Galen:<BR><B>Was there anyone in it? Did he have his seatbelt on? did he make it out? <P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes unfortunately it is a sad day in the office Galen. I have just discovered the Microsoft Office Help Assistant (The Paperclip) must have been trying to steal it and knocked over the photoshop oxy-torch. He did not have his seat belt on and yes he did make it out but was found 8" away on the desktop burnt to a crisp. An internet forensics team is currently on the scene to asertain whether he deliberately started the fire. If so legal action will commence agains't Bill Gates to recover the losses as my insurance company CCC (Cyber Car Company) have refused to pay the claim because it was my office assistant that had caused the damage and it was not listed as a driver on the policy.<P>It just gets worse all the time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
